[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nunit/nunit/issues/comments/1767418304","html_url":"https://github.com/nunit/nunit/issues/4513#issuecomment-1767418304","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nunit/nunit/issues/4513","id":1767418304,"node_id":"IC_kwDOANDtF85pWKnA","user":{"login":"manfred-brands","id":8655218,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTUyMTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8655218?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manfred-brands","html_url":"https://github.com/manfred-brands","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manfred-brands/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manfred-brands/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manfred-brands/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manfred-brands/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manfred-brands/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manfred-brands/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manfred-brands/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manfred-brands/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manfred-brands/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-10-18T00:49:52Z","updated_at":"2023-10-18T00:49:52Z","body":"I think we should disallow surrogates. They are a niche and for any code with random strings not likely to be used.\r\n\r\nWe can rename the current `GetString` into a `UnsafeGetString` and make it `private` which does not check its `allowedChars`\r\nThen the overloads which pass in `DefaultStringChars` call `UnsafeGetString` directly.\r\nCreate a new `GetString` which checks the passed in `allowedChars` and `throws` if it has an surrogates.\r\n\r\nIn addition make an NUnit test to ensure that nobody put surrogates in `DefaultStringChars`.\r\nThat way we don't affect the performance of 99% of the `GetString` calls.\r\n\r\nAlternatively make a `StringRandomizer` derived class which needs `allowedChars` in the constructor.\r\nThat way the check only has to be done once. It then has a `GetString` method without an `allowedChars` parameter.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nunit/nunit/issues/comments/1767418304/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"manfred-brands","id":8655218,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTUyMTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8655218?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manfred-brands","html_url":"https://github.com/manfred-brands","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manfred-brands/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manfred-brands/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manfred-brands/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manfred-brands/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manfred-brands/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manfred-brands/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manfred-brands/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manfred-brands/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manfred-brands/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nunit/nunit/issues/comments/1767455541","html_url":"https://github.com/nunit/nunit/issues/4513#issuecomment-1767455541","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nunit/nunit/issues/4513","id":1767455541,"node_id":"IC_kwDOANDtF85pWTs1","user":{"login":"jnm2","id":8040367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNDAzNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8040367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jnm2","html_url":"https://github.com